flowchart TD
    USER[Browser] --> FE[Frontend: React and Nginx :5173]
    FE -->|/api/v1/chat, pending-actions, memory| AI[Multi-agent service :8005]
    FE -->|/api/auth, users, tickets, bookings| BUSINESS[Business backend :8000]
    AI --> GUARD[Guardrail and context]
    GUARD --> ROUTER[Router and supervisor]
    ROUTER --> FAQ[FAQ / RAG agent]
    ROUTER --> TICKET[Ticket agent]
    ROUTER --> BOOKING[Booking agent]
    ROUTER --> IT[IT support agent]
    FAQ --> INDEX[FAISS index and embedding / reranker models]
    TICKET -->|Authenticated HTTP tools| BUSINESS
    BOOKING -->|Authenticated HTTP tools| BUSINESS
    AI --> CHATDB[(chat_service.db: conversations and approvals)]
    AI --> CP[(chat_checkpoints.db: graph state)]
    AI --> MEM[(memory_service.db: facts and episodes)]
    BUSINESS --> ID[(identity_service.db)]
    BUSINESS --> TDB[(ticket_service.db: tickets, audit, outbox)]
    BUSINESS --> BDB[(booking_service.db: bookings, audit, outbox)]
    TDB --> WORKER[In-process outbox delivery]
    BDB --> WORKER
    WORKER --> EVENTS[(events.db: deduplicated inbox)]
